:: MP Loc Orphanage Hub [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>><<mpLedgerInit>><<mpLedgerTick>>
暮色漫过宅邸街时，孤儿院那扇掉漆的橡木门照例虚掩着。门厅只点一盏熏黑的煤油灯，墙上的木牌记着名单、周债与几条红铅笔禁令。
<br><br>
牌子背后另钉着一颗新钉。<<if $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome is "mutualaid">>后院传来刨木头的钝响。<<elseif $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome is "sheltered">>门后钥匙串挂成一排。<<else>>木牌上的数目还是老样子。<</if>><<if $mpWorldLinGym or $mpWorldLinCaptain>>巷口有人守着。<</if>><<if $mpLocProgress_Orphanage gte 3>>边角划痕一道压着一道。<<elseif $mpLocProgress_Orphanage gte 1>>边角新添了一道划痕。<</if>><<if $mpWorldLedgerLoss>>靠窗的床空着，名字被炭条抹掉了。<<elseif $mpLedgerEnded>>账已经落定，夜里没人敲门。<<elseif $mpLedger.overdue gt 0>>红杠又添了几道。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>抱着旧床单从楼梯口探头，低声说<<print _bailey>>今天脸色不好，干活时动静小些。
<br><br>
<<if !$mpLedgerEnded>>煤房尽头那道暗门后藏着院长的私账，距下次翻账还有 <<print Math.max(0, ($mpLedger.nextDueDay or 0) - Time.days)>> 天<<if $mpLedger.overdue gt 0>>，已经逾期 <<print $mpLedger.overdue>> 笔<</if>>。中段的旧欠条堆能翻到它。
<br><br><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回木牌告示 (0:04)|MP Town Side Notices Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[探索孤儿院表层 (0:06)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[深入院中段 (0:08)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpLocProgress_Orphanage gte 2 or $mpLocEvents_Orphanage gte 2>><<sneakicon>><<link [[潜入孤儿院最深层 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<link [[更多日常 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Surface [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
白昼的孤儿院难得松快。后院晾衣绳上挂着湿床单，厨房小窗飘出麦粥的热气。<<print _robin>>踩着木凳收衣服，几个小的蹲在墙根数蚂蚁。
<br><br>
门边小木板用粉笔划着今日份数，划到一半停住。<<print _bailey>>办公室的窗帘掀开一角，又放下。院里没有真正的清闲，做慢了都会变成账本上的一笔。
<br><br>
厨房后窗下堆着待洗的碗。<<print _robin>>说分餐名单又添了一个从街口捡回来的孩子，<<print _bailey>>却不肯多给一份口粮。你挽起袖子，先换掉手边这盆水。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[后院晾衣绳架 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[夜宵分餐处 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 2]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去院中段 (0:06)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.max($mpLocProgress_Orphanage, 1)>><</link>>
<br><<link [[到院子里看看天色 (0:06)|MP Loc Orphanage Season]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Mid [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
入夜后，阁楼的木梯比白天更响。旧木箱摞在斜屋顶下，图书角的煤油灯照着一角暖黄，几个孩子挤在旧毯子里等你翻书。
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>把一摞旧毛衣搬下阁楼，压低声音说<<print _bailey>>上个月给里门换了新锁，想下去得先把这层的事做熟，别一个人去。
<br><br>
箱群里或许压着谁的旧物，灯下或许坐着等故事的孩子。一暗一明，都是通往深处之前的台阶。<<print _robin>>把蜡烛交到你手里，说今晚你拿主意。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[阁楼旧木箱群 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 3]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[图书角的灯 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 4]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpLocProgress_Orphanage gte 2 or $mpLocEvents_Orphanage gte 2>><<sneakicon>><<link [[进入孤儿院的深层 (0:08)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.max($mpLocProgress_Orphanage, 3)>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<link [[翻旧欠条 (0:04)|MP Ledger Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Deep [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
地下储煤间又冷又潮，煤块堆在墙角，头顶木板缝里漏下厨房的响动。再往里是院长室的厚木门，抽屉里锁着历年账册。
<br><br>
墙上粉笔正字被煤灰盖住一半。<<print _robin>>悄悄下来，把半块冷面包塞给你，说<<print _bailey>>今晚不在，院长室的门只是虚掩着。
<br><br>
煤梁若塌，楼上的孩子就要挨冻；账册若被翻出来，保护名单就会暴露。你吹熄灯，听见<<print _bailey>>的拖鞋声停了一停，又远了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[地下储煤暗室 (0:15)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 5]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[看旧账册 (0:15)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<if !$mpLedgerEnded>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[建互助工坊 (0:20)|MP Loc Orphanage Ending A]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "mutualaid">><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to 5>><</link>><br>
<<link [[继续维持静谧庇护 (0:20)|MP Loc Orphanage Ending B]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "sheltered">><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Season [nobr]
<<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
季节一变，孤儿院的难处就换一副面孔。你在门厅听了一会儿屋顶的动静，判断今天该怎么安排人手。
<br><br>
<<if Time.season is "winter">>寒冬的煤要一筐筐往楼上搬，<<print _bailey>>把煤房钥匙挂在腰上。
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋雨下个不停，床单三天不干，煤仓得提前备足。
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>暑气闷在阁楼里，麦粥放半天就发酸。
<<else>>春日返潮，墙皮鼓起，晾不干的衣物堆在浴室里。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 3>>雨雾顺着屋檐往下淌，院里容易留下脚印。
<<else>>晴日把砖墙晒暖，日头一落潮气又泛上来。<</if>>
<br><br>
无论晴雨，木牌上的字都不会变。你可以顺着天时查暗迹，也可以转入表层做活计。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcloudicon>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 3>><<link [[趁雾查暗迹 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 4]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[晴日巡外围 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 1]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转入表层院区 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br><<link [[翻节庆牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage Festival Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 1 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
午后起了风，后院的晾衣绳被吹成一道弧。<<print _robin>>抱着最后一只湿床单直起腰：「要下雨了，这几张还没干透，收晚了今晚就没有干净床单。」
<br><br>
几只夹子已经松了。收拢床单要手脚麻利，也得看清风向；腾不出手，就坐在廊下把孩子们磨破的袖口缝好。
<br><br>
<<print _bailey>>在屋里咳嗽。这几张床单是本月仅剩的干净铺盖，拖延半天，落到最小的孩子身上就是实实在在的难受。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院表层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[收拢干爽床单 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[收拢干爽床单 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[缝开线袖口 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 2 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
夜里的厨房只剩灶膛一点余火，麦粥结了薄皮。<<print _robin>>按<<print _bailey>>留下的名单数人头，叹气说今天少了两个人，可锅里的量还是照旧。
<br><br>
粮柜里的面粉袋瘪下去大半，土豆筐也见了底。分餐要手稳心细，先算还能撑几顿；不想动心思，就把粥一碗碗盛好递到孩子手里。
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>把最后一只豁口碗摆正，让你先吃一口。锅底传来焦味，你赶紧把火拨小，又把发烧孩子的那碗单独温在灶台边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院表层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[清点储藏面粉 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[清点储藏面粉 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[分装热麦粥 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回房熄灯 (0:06)|MP Loc Orphanage Sleep]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 3 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
阁楼的斜屋顶压得很低，旧木箱从墙根堆到天窗下。<<print _robin>>举着蜡烛跟在你身后：「这些箱子<<print _bailey>>不让碰，可里面有孩子们过冬的衣物，趁他不在快点清吧。」
<br><br>
最底下那只箱子的锁是新的，木缝里透出旧纸的霉味。箱群深处还有一块松动的木板，上面像是有人用指甲刻过什么。
<br><br>
整理箱子要懂得哪些该翻、哪些该原样放回；只辨认木板刻痕，倒不必冒太大的险。<<print _robin>>说这些箱子从前每个孩子分一只，后来成了堆杂物的地方。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院中层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 230 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[整理旧衣物箱 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[整理旧衣物箱 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mpveilicon>><<link [[发现木刻字 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 4 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
图书角缩在阁楼西头，煤油灯的灯芯已经烧黑。几个孩子裹着旧毯子等你翻书。<<print _robin>>把灯盏挪到中间：「油不多了，添满能撑到后半夜，可煤油得从<<print _bailey>>的柜子里取。」
<br><br>
添灯油要等他睡熟，还得记住煤油罐的位置；不想冒险，就坐下来就着半明半暗的灯教孩子们认字。
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>摸出半截铅笔和旧报纸，孩子们围拢过来跟着念。你翻开那本发黄的旧书，念一段，几颗脑袋一齐点。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院中层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplampicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 360 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[添满煤油灯盏 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[添满煤油灯盏 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[教孩童识字 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 5 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
地下储煤间的冷气顺着台阶涌上来。木梁被潮气浸黑，其中一根裂了缝；要是塌了，上面就是厨房的地板。
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>在楼梯口探头：「<<print _bailey>>说煤房不用管，可昨晚我听见这里响了一声。」他手里攥着一截麻绳。
<br><br>
加固木梁要先把楔子敲紧，再用麻绳和短木撑住裂缝；力气不够，就顺着墙角的水痕查渗水的来路。
<br><br>
楼梯口传来孩子的哭声，<<print _robin>>说是最小的那个做噩梦。你决定先把这根梁撑住。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院深层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpgearicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[加固支撑木梁 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[加固支撑木梁 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mptideicon>><<link [[查墙角渗水 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 6 [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
院长室里混着旧纸、墨水和廉价烟草的味道。写字台抽屉没锁严，露出一角硬壳账册，上面记着历年的名字、数目与日期。
<br><br>
你翻到最近一页，发现几笔资助对不上：钱进了账，却没有对应的孩子。账页边缘还夹着几张未拆的信，火漆陌生，收件人空着。
<br><br>
核对资助要把入账、支出与人头一笔笔对应；不想久留，就抄下寄件的封皮与日期。你合上账册，抽走夹在里面的一张便条——上面是日期和一个人名，字迹出自<<print _robin>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院深层 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[核对历年资助 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_Orphanage + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[核对历年资助 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[抄隐秘寄件 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Ending A [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "mutualaid">><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to 5>>
你把孩子们召集到后院，把晾衣绳解下来拉成工作台的界线。<<print _robin>>翻出旧木板钉成矮桌，大孩子学着补鞋、缝纫、修小物件，小的递工具。
<br><br>
<<print _bailey>>站在门廊下看了很久，最终什么也没说。孩子们第一次拿到自己挣的零钱，眼睛里的光比阁楼的煤油灯还亮。
<br><br>
之后，邻居拿旧衣来换修补，小贩用边角料换补好的鞋，互助工坊的名声一点点传开。傍晚收工，<<print _robin>>问「明天还开吗」，你点点头。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回孤儿院深层 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Ending B [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>><<set _bailey to (mpNpcMet("Bailey") ? "贝利" : "院长")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<set $mpWorldOrphanageOutcome to "sheltered">><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to 5>>
你没有惊动任何人。煤房的裂缝补上了，供暖管道疏通，门厅换了新锁，钥匙只交给<<print _robin>>和两个半大的孩子。
<br><br>
夜里有人敲门时，屋里的人先看灯，再看人。<<print _bailey>>问起，你只说院舍一切照旧；他盯了你半晌，终究没有再追问。
<br><br>
冬天来时，煤房的火没有断过，厨房锅里总有热的东西。孩子们学会轮班守夜、修门窗、把多出的一碗粥留给生病的人。
<br><br>
<<print _robin>>把新配的钥匙挂到门后，轻声说：「谢谢你没有把事情闹大。」你望着门厅的灯，觉得这样也很好。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回孤儿院深层 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Sleep [nobr]
<<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "院里的孩子")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>><<mpLedgerInit>><<mpLedgerTick>>
<<set _today to ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0)>>
<<set _overdue to ($mpLedger.overdue or 0)>>
<<set _forced to ((($mpLedger.patrolPending or 0) gte 1) or (_overdue gte 3 and !($mpLedger.childTaken or 0)))>>
<<set _nightUsed to ($mpLedger.lastNightDay is _today)>>
<<if !_nightUsed and $daily and $daily.mpLedgerNight>><<set $daily.mpLedgerNight to 0>><</if>>
<<set _rolled to false>>
<<if !_nightUsed and (_overdue gt 0 or _forced)>>
	<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpLedgerNight to 1>><<set $mpLedger.lastNightDay to _today>>
	<<if _forced>><<set _rolled to true>>
	<<elseif random(1, 100) lte Math.min(75, _overdue * 25)>><<set _rolled to true>><</if>>
<</if>>
楼上的走廊只剩一盏罩子熏黑的夜灯，孩子们挤在旧毯子里，呼吸声一层压着一层。你把门闩摸了一遍，才在靠墙的床铺上坐下。
<br><br>
<<if $mpWorldLedgerLoss>>靠窗那张床空着，谁也不再提那个名字。<<elseif $mpLedgerEnded>>账已经落定，这一夜难得没人来敲门。<<else>>街面上偶尔有车轮碾过，你听了一会儿才躺下。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _rolled>>
刚合眼，门厅的铜环就响了。<<print _robin>>先坐起来，把你的袖子拽了一下。
<<else>>
这一夜没有多余的脚步声，风从窗缝里钻进来，把灯焰压低。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回门厅去 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _rolled>>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[应付夜里的敲门 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Night]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[先把罗宾叫醒帮忙 (0:08)|MP Ledger Punish Night]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLedgerNightAlly to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[睡到天亮吧 (0:20)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 20>><<if ($mpLocOrphanageRestDay or -1) isnt _today>><<set $mpLocOrphanageRestDay to _today>><<stress -3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<link [[再守一会儿夜 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Deep]]>><<pass 10>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
